📊 Program 14 — File Statistics Mini-Project

📌 Description

This mini-project creates a file-analysis application that accepts a file name from the user and calculates multiple statistics from its contents.

The program counts lines, words, characters, vowels, digits, and spaces, providing a practical application of C++ file streams and text processing.

🔑 Concepts Covered

- 📂 User-specified file input
- 📊 File statistics
- 📏 Line counting
- 🔤 Word and character counting
- 🔡 Vowel counting
- 🔢 Digit counting
- ⬜ Space counting
- ⚠️ File error handling

🧠 Main Concept

Combining file handling with text analysis
